# Keep viridian's docs as garden nodes

The [design](viri:soqlqxoq) and the [first slice](viri:wopxuwkn) moved
from `docs/` into `garden/`, so viridian's own docs are the first real
data. Docs link to each other with `viri:` links. `created` replaces
dated filenames, and the docs carry no tags, because links already
relate them.
